                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='From Analysis to Action&#10;&#10;Manufacturers should validate sales records, compare driving range and price across vehicle categories, evaluate battery technology representation, and investigate customer ratings using reliable supporting data. These findings can guide further research and product planning, but verified market data is needed before making investment or market-share decisions.' captured-sheet='EV Market Intelligence' id='1' />
